OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at Rob
OL,7,     Fand Jo's dog-friendly B&B in Hope
OL,8,     FMountain in North Wales. But tough
OL,9,     Ffeedback leaves them ready to
OL,10,     Ffight back.
OL,11,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FSelf-confessed 'queens of clean'
OL,13,     FSteffi and Sarah welcome their
OL,14,     Frivals to the Beaumont Hotel in
OL,15,     FLouth, near Lincoln. Jo and Rob
OL,16,     Finspect their room with a
OL,17,     Ffine-tooth comb.
