OL,5,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIdentical twins Emilio and
OL,7,     FFernando host at Rock House Hotel
OL,8,     Fin Devon. But Sarah and Steffi
OL,9,     Fmake a hairy discovery on their
OL,10,     Ffloor, and breakfast is a
OL,11,     Fcatalogue of errors.
OL,12,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe final visit is to Troy House
OL,14,     Fin Painswick, Gloucestershire,
OL,15,     Fwhere Alan and Denise hope that
OL,16,     Ftheir guests will love their
OL,17,     Frooms. But tensions are revealed
OL,18,     Fand battle lines drawn.
