OL,5,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time. Tensions run
OL,9,     Fhigh as home truths are delivered,
OL,10,     Fbefore the payments are revealed
OL,11,     Fand the winner is announced.
OL,12,G1240 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FEdinburgh. The first host,
OL,14,     FChristian radio DJ and gospel
OL,15,     Fsinger Eloho, hopes that her
OL,16,     Fguests will sing her praises after
OL,17,     Fher music-filled evening and
OL,18,     Ftraditional Nigerian fare. (Ep1/5)
