OL,5,G1310 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FEdinburgh. Cabin crew trainer
OL,7,     FJulie plans an evening of Scottish
OL,8,     Ffine dining, including a hearty
OL,9,     Fwinter warmer, her grandmother's
OL,10,     FCullen skink and a full Scottish
OL,11,     Fpipe band. (Ep2/5)
OL,12,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FEdinburgh. IT manager and
OL,14,     Foccasional stand-up comic Ryan
OL,15,     Fhosts with a menu designed by his
OL,16,     Ffriend who's a Michelin-starred
OL,17,     Fchef. But Ryan has no idea how to
OL,18,     Fcook any of it! (Ep3/5)
