OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition begins at
OL,7,     FCedarwood Holidays in Cornwall,
OL,8,     Fwhere Kirstie and Joe's pristine
OL,9,     Fglamping pods and a chance to feed
OL,10,     Fseals go down a treat. Will things
OL,11,     Fstay flawless at breakfast?
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers are still in Cornwall
OL,14,     Ffor the week's second visit, at
OL,15,     FThe Llawnroc Hotel, where former
OL,16,     FRedcoats Craig and Rachel are
OL,17,     Fbanking on being able to keep
OL,18,     Ftheir guests entertained.
