OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's a hat-trick! The B&Bers spend
OL,7,     Fa third consecutive visit in
OL,8,     FCornwall, at ex-military man Jo's
OL,9,     FThe Olde Malthouse, where he's
OL,10,     Fhoping to wow his guests with his
OL,11,     FB&B's heritage charm.
OL,12,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers head to Dorset for the
OL,14,     Fweek's final visit, at The
OL,15,     FBritannia Inn, run by Hannah and
OL,16,     FLee. The controversial pricing at
OL,17,     Fbreakfast leaves one guest with a
OL,18,     Fsour taste.
