OL,5,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode focuses on the
OL,7,     Fimportance of having someone to
OL,8,     Flove and support us when life gets
OL,9,     Ftough. Gerald, who's 66, has
OL,10,     Ffallen from his loft and down two
OL,11,     Fflights of stairs.
OL,12,G0005 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics treat a range of cases,
OL,14,     Fincluding a man with severe chest
OL,15,     Fpains, a 103-year-old who's had a
OL,16,     Ffall, and a woman who may have a
OL,17,     Fbleed on the brain.
